2.3 Renaming — the open item from the draft, resolved

Workspace URLs are built on the workspace GUID, not the name, so renaming a workspace does not break existing links or browser bookmarks.

What renaming does break:

XMLA endpoint connection strings, which use the workspace name (powerbi://api.powerbi.com/v1.0/myorg/<WorkspaceName>)
DirectQuery and live connections to semantic models that resolve by workspace name
Deployment pipeline documentation, scripts, and anything hard-coding the name

So a mass rename is safe for consumers and unsafe for developers and integrations. Sequence it: inventory XMLA and DirectQuery dependencies first, rename, then repoint.

